From 7c61e70cafb1d63ead3c728b5ddb5783d00088b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Mon, 05 Oct 2026 22:54:36 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Migrate settings to AndroidX and Material 3 Expressive

Move the settings, spell checker and dictionary settings screens from
the deprecated framework preference framework to AndroidX preferences
hosted in an AppCompat activity with a collapsing toolbar, following
the Material 3 Expressive settings setup used by Twelve.

Dialog preferences now use preference dialog fragments, toggles render
as Material switches, dialogs use the Material alert dialog builder,
and the add-on dictionaries list shows a persistent action button
instead of the tap-to-reveal button switcher.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ie7a85aa452270dec57c5e8d93574ac49c4b50ad0
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

